{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04116","headline":"打球篇 · 蔡孚","name":"打球篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"德阳宫北苑东头，云作高台月作楼。\n金鎚玉蓥千金地，宝杖琱文七宝球。\n窦融一家三尚主，梁翼频封万户侯。\n容色由来荷恩顾，意气平生事侠游。\n共道用兵如断蔗，俱能走马入长楸。\n红鬣锦鬃风騄骥，黄络青丝电紫骝。\n奔星乱下花场里，初月飞来画杖头。\n自有长鸣须决胜，能驰迅走满先筹。\n薄暮汉宫愉乐罢，还归尧室晓垂旒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"蔡孚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04116.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04116","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}